.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262747_3466081456958639_5409178534417992419_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bezCWNBZ9D8Q7kNvwEQbQB5&_nc_oc=AdonT4p_V5EOOUQ8DJpaQxteLMawNjLkLv59nMIkxuzU0FuLba8ycIKM6CAzUuc2I00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGCZWm7Nag1bs07vryXo4E1XDSOyxBU_LXpNseCeoCNrw&oe=6A8EE996"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Manic Macacas", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome! You are a Japanese Macaca, or here a Snow Monkey!!\nYou live in a snowy forest...or..is it a forest? Looks more like a pit with clouds above it...Anyways, you can run, jump, climb, and do whatever else a monkey can do ALL while in the comfort of your own home! We also have a rising lava game mode (Disclaimer: not real lava) and we have... an odd tunnel that leads to a dark cave with a.. macaca in containment? Why would he be there?\nAnyways, play today and enjoy being a monkey!", "short_description": "Welcome! You are a Japanese Macaca, or here a Snow Monkey!!\nYou live in a snowy forest...or..is it a forest? Looks more like a pit with clouds above it...Anyways, you can run, jump, climb, and do whatever else a monkey can do ALL while in the comfort of your own home! We also have a rising lava game mode (Disclaimer: not real lava) and we have... an odd tunnel that leads to a dark cave with a.. macaca in containment? Why would he be there?\nAnyways, play today and enjoy being a monkey!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Kx9ClIAKKxIyFgAdipbJpOgAii7uFH6Jz-0CtyDdgtY/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ZenekVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://linktr.ee/zenekvr", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type":